    "f3b08bbf485a75bb2ad63a885fd3366a2bbe290f8c90608c098ffd117b561741": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "4d6d1aedc76e3f94d175178d0fee971012d25ffdc5445f14276beff48e32cdf8",
      "contextFingerprint": "6850c93289d9e9734cb2b5c1dcb5244793ef4ebda16ef65863fffeb5c12e791c",
      "sourceText": "1.  加速度计（Accelerometer）：用于测量物体的加速度，通常以三个轴向（X、Y、Z）提供加速度数据。加速度计可以帮助判断物体的线性运动和动作姿态变化。\n\n2.  陀螺仪（Gyroscope）：用于测量物体的角速度或角度变化率。陀螺仪可以提供关于物体旋转的信息，判断物体的角度、方向和转动动作。\n\n3.  磁力计（Magnetometer）：用于测量物体周围的磁场强度和方向（即测量场强）。磁力计可以帮助判断物体的方向和导航，尤其在地磁定位和航向控制中起重要作用。",
      "translatedText": "1.  Accelerometer: Used to measure the acceleration of an object, typically providing acceleration data along three axes (X, Y, Z)\\. An accelerometer can help determine an object's linear motion and changes in motion posture\\.\n\n2.  Gyroscope: Used to measure an object's angular velocity or rate of change of angle\\. A gyroscope can provide information about an object's rotation, determining its angle, orientation, and rotational motion\\.\n\n3.  Magnetometer: Used to measure the strength and direction of the magnetic field around an object (that is, to measure field strength)\\. A magnetometer can help determine an object's orientation and navigation, and plays an important role especially in geomagnetic positioning and heading control\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 246,
        "outputTokens": 148,
        "costUsd": 0.000252
      }
    },
